rooms_desc ({"Opposite the front door is a big clock to let you know what time it is.On your left is a mirror to let you know how beautiful you are.On your right is a portrait of Package to let you know how beautiful he is.","You are immediately impressed by Package's choice of tasteful beanbags whichare all over the place. These allow you to recline comfortably while youwatch the bigscreen cinema type thing on the wall. The drinks cabinet is wellstocked, but only with stuff that Package likes to drink. Unlucky!If you ask nicely he might get you a drink (if he's here that is).","You notice that Package eats a lot from the amount of stuff in here.But then that's no surprise, is it?There's loads of mackerel on the shelves.","What a boring hall. Get a life Package!Still, at least he's not as fat as you are, eh?","Package used to keep his bike in here, but then he had to sell it.Sad really, but the cost of living forced him to start walking everywhere.It was a nice bike as well, and Package was well gutted when it had to go.Never mind, eh?",0,0,0,0,0,})
